msgid "Visual Studio Code"
msgstr "Visual Studio Code"

msgid "General"
msgstr "全般"

msgid "move by word"
msgstr "単語単位で移動"

msgid "move a tab from one of two split editors to another"
msgstr "2 つに分割したエディターの一方から他方へ、タブを移動"

msgid "focus the editor"
msgstr "エディターにフォーカス"

msgid "move tab"
msgstr "タブを移動"

msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "移動"

msgid "go to line"
msgstr "指定した行へ移動"

msgid ""
"`Bracket matching "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/editingevolved#_bracket-"
"matching>`_"
msgstr ""
"`対応する括弧へ移動 <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/editingevolved"
"#_bracket-matching>`_"

msgid "go to references"
msgstr "参照へ移動"

msgid "multi-cursor / Selection"
msgstr "マルチカーソルと選択"

msgid "extend selection by word"
msgstr "単語単位で選択範囲を広げる"

msgid "column box selection"
msgstr "矩形選択"

msgid "Select all occurrences of current selection"
msgstr "選択中の文字列と同じものをすべて選択"

msgid "Editing"
msgstr "編集"

msgid "insert line below"
msgstr "下に行を挿入"

msgid "insert line above"
msgstr "上に行を挿入"

msgid "move line up/down"
msgstr "行を上/下へ移動"

msgid "Replace text in bulk"
msgstr "テキストを一括で置換"

msgid "Window Management"
msgstr "ウィンドウの操作"

msgid "Focus into First/Second Editor Group"
msgstr "1 つ目/2 つ目のエディターグループにフォーカス"

msgid "Move to previous terminal"
msgstr "前のターミナルへ移動"

msgid "Move to previous editor"
msgstr "前のエディターへ移動"

msgid "Move to next editor"
msgstr "次のエディターへ移動"

msgid "Display"
msgstr "表示"

msgid "Show source control"
msgstr "ソース管理を表示"

msgid "Open Preview to the Side"
msgstr "横にプレビューを開く"

msgid "Toggle integrated terminal"
msgstr "統合ターミナルを切り替え"

msgid "Development"
msgstr "開発"

msgid ""
"You can navigate symbols inside a file with ⇧⌘O. By typing : the symbols "
"will be grouped by category. Press Up or Down and navigate to the place "
"you want. ( `See Also "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/editingevolved#_go-to-"
"symbol>`_ )"
msgstr ""
"⇧⌘O でファイル内のシンボルへ移動できる。: を入力すると、シンボルが種類ごとにまとまる。上下キーで目的の場所まで移動する。詳しくは `Go "
"to Symbol <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/editingevolved#_go-"
"to-symbol>`_ を参照"

msgid "Copilot Chat"
msgstr "Copilot Chat"

msgid "Expand/Collapse current code block"
msgstr "現在のコードブロックを展開/折りたたみ"

msgid "Panel"
msgstr "パネル"

msgid "output"
msgstr "出力"

msgid "debug console"
msgstr "デバッグコンソール"

msgid "Sidebars"
msgstr "サイドバー"

msgid "Explorer: Focus on Open Editors View"
msgstr "エクスプローラー: 開いているエディターのビューにフォーカス"

msgid ""
"`Search for files in the File Explorer "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_94#_find-in-explorer>`_"
msgstr ""
"`エクスプローラーでファイルを検索 <https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_94#_find-in-"
"explorer>`_"

msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "拡張機能"

msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Bookmarks"

msgid "Mark/unmark positions in your code"
msgstr "コードの位置に印を付ける/外す"

msgid "Jump forward and backward between bookmarks"
msgstr "ブックマークの間を前後に移動"

msgid "GitHub Copilot"
msgstr "GitHub Copilot"

msgid "Accept Panel Suggestion at the Cursor"
msgstr "カーソル位置で、パネルの提案を受け入れる"

msgid "Accept suggestion word by word"
msgstr "提案を単語ごとに受け入れる"

msgid "Debug Last Terminal Command"
msgstr "最後のターミナルコマンドをデバッグ"

msgid "Navigate to the Next Panel Suggestion"
msgstr "パネルの次の提案へ移動"

msgid "Navigate to the Previous Panel Suggestion"
msgstr "パネルの前の提案へ移動"

msgid "Toggle Copilot Chat"
msgstr "Copilot Chat を切り替え"

msgid ""
"`Undo requests <https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_101#_chat-ux-"
"improvements>`_"
msgstr ""
"`リクエストを取り消す <https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_101#_chat-ux-"
"improvements>`_"

msgid "Context Variables"
msgstr "コンテキスト変数"

msgid "Selected text in the editor"
msgstr "エディターで選択中のテキスト"

msgid "Selected text in the terminal"
msgstr "ターミナルで選択中のテキスト"

msgid "Last executed command and its result in the terminal"
msgstr "ターミナルで最後に実行したコマンドと、その結果"

msgid ""
"Analyzes highly relevant code and files from the entire current workspace"
" and adds them as context for prompts."
msgstr "現在のワークスペース全体から関連の深いコードとファイルを分析し、プロンプトのコンテキストに加える"

msgid ""
"Retrieves web page content from the specified URL and adds it to the "
"context."
msgstr "指定した URL のウェブページの内容を取得し、コンテキストに加える"

msgid ""
"By entering a file or folder name after # (e.g., #src/main.js), you can "
"explicitly add the contents of that file or folder as context for the "
"chat."
msgstr "# の後にファイル名かフォルダ名を入力すると（例: #src/main.js）、その中身をチャットのコンテキストとして明示的に加えられる"

msgid ""
"By entering a symbol name such as function name, class name, or variable "
"name after # (e.g., #myFunction), it searches for the definition and "
"reference locations of the corresponding symbol from files in the "
"workspace and adds them as context."
msgstr ""
"# の後に関数名、クラス名、変数名などのシンボル名を入力すると（例: "
"#myFunction）、ワークスペースのファイルからそのシンボルの定義と参照箇所を探し、コンテキストに加える"

msgid ""
"Adds information about tests that failed in the most recent test "
"execution as context. This is useful for debugging test code and "
"identifying areas that need fixing."
msgstr "直近のテスト実行で失敗したテストの情報を、コンテキストに加える。テストコードのデバッグや、直すべき箇所の特定に役立つ"

msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "コマンドパレット"

msgid "Attach to a Docker container"
msgstr "Docker コンテナーに接続"

msgid "edit and find available key bindings"
msgstr "使えるキー割り当てを探して編集"

msgid "split an editor"
msgstr "エディターを分割"

msgid "move a tab from A to B"
msgstr "タブを A から B へ移動"

msgid "Core CLI options"
msgstr "主な CLI オプション"

msgid "Open a file difference editor. Requires two file paths as arguments."
msgstr "ファイルの差分エディターを開く。引数に 2 つのファイルパスが要る"

msgid "Forces opening a file or folder in the last active window."
msgstr "ファイルやフォルダを、最後に使っていたウィンドウで開く"

msgid ""
"`vscode cheat sheet <https://code.visualstudio.com/shortcuts/keyboard-"
"shortcuts-macos.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"`VS Code のチートシート（英語、PDF） <https://code.visualstudio.com/shortcuts"
"/keyboard-shortcuts-macos.pdf>`_"

